  "project_description": "Submodule of Eulerian that supplies the Eulerian JavaScript datalayer on Commerce product-canonical pages. On entity.commerce_product.canonical it adds the product reference (prdref = product UUID) and name (prdname = product label) to drupalSettings.eulerian.datalayer, and dispatches a CommerceProductParamsEvent so other modules can add prdparam-* attributes. Requires the base eulerian module and commerce_product.",
